# FirstCry

1. Overview

Company: FirstCry 
Industry: Baby & Kids E-commerce 
Website: https://www.firstcry.com 
Headquarters: Pune, India 
Business Type: Online marketplace + retail brand

FirstCry.com is one of India's largest e-commerce platforms dedicated to baby, kids, and maternity products. The platform serves parents, expecting parents, families, and caregivers, offering a wide range of products designed for infants, toddlers, children, and mothers.

The platform provides products across multiple parenting and childcare needs, including:

-   Baby care products
-   Kids clothing and fashion
-   Toys and games
-   Diapers and potty training products
-   Feeding and nursing accessories
-   Maternity products
-   Baby gear and travel equipment
-   School supplies
-   Children's books and learning materials

FirstCry.com operates as both: - A multi-brand marketplace - A retail platform with private label brands such as Babyhug, Pine Kids, Bonfino, Babyoye, Cute Walk, Kookie Kids, Playnation, Holaboita and Honeyhap.

